WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Narrator: Now Noura in a car park at dusk.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:09.400
Narrator: Approved signals only, big and slow, one at a time, with eye contact.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.800
Narrator: She stands in a well-lit area and keeps the sun to her side, so drivers can see her.

4
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:20.200
Narrator: She never stands in a car's path, and she always has an escape route.
